OL,3,GNEWSALegal challenge over sex education
OL,4,Arow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has launched a legal
OL,7,Fchallenge of sanctions made against him
OL,8,Fafter he raised concerns regarding a
OL,9,Ffamily event held at a library
OL,10,Ffeaturing sex education objects
OL,11,Fincluding anatomical models of
OL,12,Fgenitalia.
OL,14,FMichael Fife Cook, leader of the Reform
OL,15,FUK group on Devon County Council, was
OL,16,Ffound to have breached the council's
OL,17,Fcode of conduct when he questioned
OL,18,Fwhether council officers could "be
OL,19,Ftrusted in safeguarding children"
OL,20,Ffollowing the Out There Queer Fest
OL,21,Fevent at Exeter Library.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
