OL,3,GNEWSALegal challenge over sex education
OL,4,Arow
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Free Speech Union is representing
OL,7,FFife Cook in a potential judicial
OL,8,Freview of the decision by the council's
OL,9,Fstandards committee.
OL,11,FDevon County Council has not commented
OL,12,Fon the legal proceedings.
